OL,3,GNEWSA'Irreplaceable' head teacher
OL,4,Amourned after murder
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Michael was my safety net," said Sarah
OL,7,FMullins as she described the loss of
OL,8,Fher husband, a head teacher who was
OL,9,Fmurdered while cycling home from work.
OL,11,FMichael Mullins, 56, loved music, was
OL,12,Flearning to play the guitar and would
OL,13,Fcollect his daughter and her friends
OL,14,Ffrom concerts to make sure they got
OL,15,Fhome safely.
OL,17,FColleagues said he had transformed
OL,18,FStretford Grammar School in Trafford,
OL,19,FGreater Manchester, after becoming head
OL,20,Fteacher in 2009, when it was in special
OL,21,Fmeasures, and that his death had left
OL,22,F"a void at every level".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
