OL,3,GNEWSA'Irreplaceable' head teacher
OL,4,Amourned after murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tributes were heard at Manchester
OL,7,FMinshull Street Crown Court as Simon
OL,8,FRichardson, 35, was jailed for life
OL,9,Fwith a minimum term of 25 years for
OL,10,Fmurdering Mullins on 20 April.
